ready  absorbed and therefore things start to  become clear whereas the attempt to  teach these basics up front too early at  least in me creates resistance I can't  read I don't know what you're talking  about  I don't know enough about the language  so the message here is the basics we  have to go back there over and over  again  we might start with an overview but then  get into the language get words into you  get experience with the language and  then go back to the basics and then with  this renewed sense of what happens in  the language go back to more input more  reading and listening and then again you  can review the basics that to me isn't  how we learn the basics and whatever we  learn in languages we forget so we  learned the basics we forget the basics  we learn the basics we forget the basics  that's how it works  anyway thank you for listening I look  forward to your comments  [Music]
 

